<title>FRANCE: Breakdown of French grain/oilseed output estimate.</title>
<headline>Breakdown of French grain/oilseed output estimate.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1996-12-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Following is a summary of 1996 grain and oilseed production estimates for France published by the farm ministry on Thursday.</p>
<p>They are unchanged from estimates published on November 15.</p>
<p>The figures have been re-issued as effective December 1.</p>
